    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the mouse (or gamepad) to control your character and jump as high as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some rocks are very slippery, so take your time! Grab onto them with your hammer and carefully plan your next move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541550/extras/85f22166f330bc51cc7a2b0748839da2.poster.avif?t=1754588997\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541550/extras/85f22166f330bc51cc7a2b0748839da2.webm?t=1754588997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541550/extras/85f22166f330bc51cc7a2b0748839da2.mp4?t=1754588997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb mountains and challenging levels with your trusty hammer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you fall, you lose all your progress, a true test of patience and skill!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game automatically saves your progress, allowing you to pick up exactly where you left off.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compare your best times with other players through the integrated global leaderboard!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can\u2019t die, but every misstep serves as a reminder of your determination... or frustration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tribute to human resilience, where every fall is a new opportunity (or perhaps a reason to throw your controller across the room).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541550/extras/85a2b2c0c0c3ec63688ba022401337ca.poster.avif?t=1754588997\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541550/extras/85a2b2c0c0c3ec63688ba022401337ca.webm?t=1754588997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541550/extras/85a2b2c0c0c3ec63688ba022401337ca.mp4?t=1754588997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customization</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock unique skins and customizations for your cardboard box and character by completing challenges and levels!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541550/extras/e30276ea0b057196b6cd12b7b9366a85.poster.avif?t=1754588997\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541550/extras/e30276ea0b057196b6cd12b7b9366a85.webm?t=1754588997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541550/extras/e30276ea0b057196b6cd12b7b9366a85.mp4?t=1754588997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer Mode!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge your friends (or total strangers) in real-time! See who can climb the highest before falling spectacularly.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Leaderboard for Multiplayer.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emotes.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chat System</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541550/extras/dbc6c8fe14ead1bc00d4e08977a9b7cd.poster.avif?t=1754588997\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541550/extras/dbc6c8fe14ead1bc00d4e08977a9b7cd.webm?t=1754588997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541550/extras/dbc6c8fe14ead1bc00d4e08977a9b7cd.mp4?t=1754588997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Notes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game is a tribute to &quot;Getting Over It with Bennett Foddy.&quot;</strong> A special thanks to Bennett Foddy for the support and inspiration to create &quot;One Box One Goal.&quot; I've always wondered what &quot;Getting Over It&quot; would feel like in 3D, and this is the result!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controls have been refined to perfectly suit the new 3D perspective, ensuring a smooth and immersive experience.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541550/extras/1c5c29d07e743d246e189cb12ad38f72.poster.avif?t=1754588997\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541550/extras/1c5c29d07e743d246e189cb12ad38f72.webm?t=1754588997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541550/extras/1c5c29d07e743d246e189cb12ad38f72.mp4?t=1754588997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the mouse (or gamepad) to control your character and jump as high as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some rocks are very slippery, so take your time! Grab onto them with your hammer and carefully plan your next move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541550/extras/85f22166f330bc51cc7a2b0748839da2.poster.avif?t=1754588997\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541550/extras/85f22166f330bc51cc7a2b0748839da2.webm?t=1754588997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2541550/extras/85f22166f330bc51cc7a2b0748839da2.mp4?t=1754588997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb mountains and challenging levels with your trusty hammer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you fall, you lose all your progress, a true test of patience and skill!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game automatically saves your progress, allowing you to pick up exactly where you left off.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compare your best times with other players through the integrated global leaderboard!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can\u2019t die, but every misstep serves as a reminder of your determination... or frustration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tribute to human resilience, where every fall is a new opportunity (or perhaps a reason to throw your controller across the room).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steams